\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   I have a place for my sins,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 It lies on the Great Lamb!
\par To carry my sins alone
\par was too heavy for me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Under the cross of Jesus,
\par I bring all my burdens,
\par and Jesus with His own blood
\par shall cleanse all of my sins.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  I've had a place for my sins !
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  It lies upon my Lord;
\par  He gave to me His good things,
\par  and rescued me my soul.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus has carried my pains,
\par  My burden and my thoughts.
\par \cf1  \cf0 Out of my distress, He bought
\par  me by His blood I'm free.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  I've had a place for my soul,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  the lost life soul of mine.
\par The hand of God that clinched me,
\par unto His bosom lean.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I have the Saviour's good name,
\par Jesus, Immanuel;
\par It's like the sweet scent olive
\par that smells all around me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I have to me my Jesus,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 His meekness, peace and Love.
\par I have to me my Jesus,
\par The Holy Son of God.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I'm also with Him always,
\par As one of His children,
\par And I will join all the saints
\par \pard         To praise Him evermore.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

